{
  "format": "srwb",
  "format_version": "1.0",
  "exported_at": "2026-08-15T15:47:15.056Z",
  "notebook": {
    "id": "default",
    "name": "ggplot2 ショーケース",
    "autoNameNumber": null,
    "description": "",
    "kernelLanguage": "r",
    "catalogId": null,
    "catalogRevision": null,
    "cellCounter": 13,
    "cells": [
      {
        "id": 1,
        "code": "# ggplot2 ショーケース\n\nSciREPL のダークテーマが自動適用されたインタラクティブな ggplot2 グラフ — 追加の設定は不要です。\n\nR の組み込みデータセット（`mpg`、`mtcars`）を使用します。データのダウンロードは不要です。",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 2,
        "code": "install.packages(\"ggplot2\")\nlibrary(ggplot2)\ncat(\"ggplot2 が読み込まれました — theme_scirepl() が自動適用されました\\n\")",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "r",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "ggplot2 が読み込まれました — theme_scirepl() が自動適用されました",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">ggplot2 が読み込まれました — theme_scirepl() が自動適用されました</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 3,
        "code": "## 1. トレンドライン付き散布図",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 4,
        "code": "ggplot(mpg, aes(displ, hwy, color = class)) +\n  geom_point(size = 2, alpha = 0.7) +\n  geom_smooth(method = \"lm\", se = FALSE, color = \"#58a6ff\") +\n  labs(title = \"エンジン排気量 vs 高速道路燃費 (MPG)\",\n       x = \"排気量 (L)\", y = \"高速道路燃費 (MPG)\")",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "r",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "`geom_smooth()` using formula = 'y ~ x'",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">`geom_smooth()` using formula = 'y ~ x'</pre><img src=\"blob:http://localhost:8090/e88011a4-566e-4432-8c37-3db65a82c221\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin-top: 8px;\">"
      },
      {
        "id": 5,
        "code": "## 2. ファセット分割棒グラフ",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 6,
        "code": "ggplot(mpg, aes(class, fill = drv)) +\n  geom_bar(position = \"dodge\") +\n  facet_wrap(~year) +\n  labs(title = \"駆動方式別の車種クラス (1999年 vs 2008年)\",\n       x = \"クラス\", y = \"件数\") +\n  theme(axis.text.x = element_text(angle = 45, hjust = 1))",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "r",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<img src=\"blob:http://localhost:8090/7e983ed2-89fc-49c2-b50b-9a529a43b25e\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin-top: 8px;\">"
      },
      {
        "id": 7,
        "code": "## 3. 密度プロット",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 8,
        "code": "ggplot(mpg, aes(hwy, fill = drv)) +\n  geom_density(alpha = 0.5) +\n  labs(title = \"駆動方式別の高速道路燃費 (MPG) 分布\",\n       x = \"高速道路燃費 (MPG)\", y = \"密度\")",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "r",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<img src=\"blob:http://localhost:8090/37354943-4666-4b99-8a8e-12a937022484\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin-top: 8px;\">"
      },
      {
        "id": 9,
        "code": "## 4. ジッター付き箱ひげ図",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 10,
        "code": "ggplot(mpg, aes(class, hwy, fill = class)) +\n  geom_boxplot(alpha = 0.7, show.legend = FALSE) +\n  geom_jitter(width = 0.2, alpha = 0.3, size = 1) +\n  labs(title = \"車種クラス別の高速道路燃費 (MPG)\",\n       x = \"クラス\", y = \"高速道路燃費 (MPG)\") +\n  coord_flip()",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "r",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<img src=\"blob:http://localhost:8090/b92e7905-391f-48db-b482-5999d0d94b07\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin-top: 8px;\">"
      },
      {
        "id": 11,
        "code": "## 5. 相関ヒートマップ",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 12,
        "code": "corr <- round(cor(mtcars), 2)\nvars <- colnames(mtcars)\ngrid <- expand.grid(x = vars, y = vars)\ngrid$value <- as.vector(corr)\nggplot(grid, aes(x, y, fill = value)) +\n  geom_tile(color = \"#30363d\") +\n  geom_text(aes(label = ifelse(abs(value) > 0.5, value, \"\")),\n            color = \"#e6edf3\", size = 2.5) +\n  scale_fill_gradient2(low = \"#f85149\", mid = \"#161b22\", high = \"#58a6ff\",\n                       midpoint = 0, limits = c(-1, 1)) +\n  labs(title = \"mtcars 相関ヒートマップ\", fill = \"r\") +\n  theme(axis.text.x = element_text(angle = 45, hjust = 1))",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "r",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<img src=\"blob:http://localhost:8090/6b124fbc-d69c-4352-8c57-d018e092c2eb\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin-top: 8px;\">"
      },
      {
        "id": 13,
        "code": "## まとめ\n\n上記のすべてのグラフは、SciREPL で ggplot2 が読み込まれたときに自動適用される `theme_scirepl()` を使用しています。\n\n標準の ggplot2 の `+ theme(...)` による上書きで、任意のグラフを自由にカスタマイズできます。",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      }
    ]
  }
}